"""Test point: bare 0.8 mm round SMD pad on the top copper.

Footprint from the Altium MicrasLib "TestPoint": one 0.8 mm round SMD pad with
mask and paste openings, 1.2 mm silkscreen circle. The paste opening tins the
pad during reflow. No part is placed: the test point is excluded from the BOM
and the placement file.

The prefix is a config so a test point can carry a functional designator.
"""

prefix = config(str, default="TP", help="Reference designator prefix")

P1 = io(Net)

Component(
    name="TP",
    prefix=prefix,
    symbol=Symbol(library="TestPoint.kicad_sym"),
    pins={"1": P1},
    skip_bom=True,
    skip_pos=True,
)
